@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:security;architecture] workspace-ai-output-retains-server-context-provenance
Personal workspace task state MUST retain the complete server-assembled repository
provenance, including immutable IDs, through completion and wait/list publication.
Provider citations, snapshot cursors, missing diff records and caller-supplied hints
MUST NOT reduce or replace it. This internal metadata MUST NOT appear in client task
snapshots. Saved Inbox answers used as later context MUST retain and reauthorize
their complete provenance; failed and stopped turns MUST retain the same trusted
run provenance alongside saved activities, including a captured empty set before
repository context is consumed. An old turn without provenance MUST fail closed.
Source: confirmed ce-code-review finding 4 and Tavi's 25 Oct 2026 assigned fix batch.
